      "role": "user",
      "content": "Yeah, go ahead and do the deep dive. But don't just look at the positives—I need you to be really critical. Look for any potential failure points, throughput bottlenecks, or logic degradation that might happen if we move away from our specialized architecture. We need to know exactly what the risks are before we commit.",
